Divya Law Associates, a leading Patna based Corporate Law Firm is looking for an 'Associate' to assist it's Litigation Team.

Job Requirement:
Must be enrolled with the Bar Council;
Must have 0-1 year PQE in the field of Consumer/ DRT Matters;
Must be based in Patna or willing to relocate;
Good oral and written communication skills;
Good drafting skills and willing to work in a team.

Interested candidates may send their updated resume at divyalawassociates@gmail.com
